    "parts": {
      "when": "[Either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), after an enemy unit picks its targets.",
      "target": "A **KABAL** or **BLADES FOR HIRE** unit of yours that is a target of any of that enemy unit's attacks, and a **DRUKHARI** unit of yours that is not a **VEHICLE**.",
      "effect": "Whenever an attack would be allocated to a model in the **KABAL** or **BLADES FOR HIRE** unit while the attacking model is in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of the **DRUKHARI** unit, the attack skips its saving throw, and the **DRUKHARI** unit instead takes as many [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) as the attack's D, for the rest of the phase."
    },
